From 7ef2c922320ecb5ce4443560601e51b59c975e37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 21:01:54 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: airoha: add EN7528 GPHY calibration

The EN7528 integrated switch exposes four GPHYs at MDIO addresses 9
through 12 using PHY ID 0x03a29491. Without a matching PHY driver they
bind to Generic PHY and skip the vendor analog calibration flow.

Port the EN7528 initialization and calibration data from the vendor
tcetherphy_7528.c implementation. Add the MMD and Token Ring tuning,
REXT and R45 calibration, TX offset and amplitude calibration, RX offset
handling, the EN7528 LDO setting, and the CHIP-SCU RASEL mirror.
Register the PHY ID and restart autonegotiation after calibration.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Samapio Queiroga <me@sirherobrine23.com.br>
Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
